WEBVTT

00:11.230 --> 00:12.370
<b>It did nothing!</b>

00:12.370 --> 00:15.490
<b>Defeating something like 
that is... just impossible!</b>

00:18.010 --> 00:22.900
<b><i>That moment, I encountered something 
my magic didn't work against.</i></b>

00:30.610 --> 00:32.210
<b>I don't know who you are, but...</b>

00:36.410 --> 00:37.590
<b>What do you want?</b>

00:38.870 --> 00:41.690
<b>You're as intense as the rumors say.</b>

00:41.690 --> 00:43.900
<b>Do you mind putting something on first?</b>

00:45.580 --> 00:49.700
<b>You seem pretty interesting. 
Want to spar with me?</b>

00:49.700 --> 00:51.360
<b>Absolutely not.</b>

00:52.290 --> 00:54.990
<b>Oho. So Yami and Vangeance...</b>

00:55.340 --> 00:58.890
<b>I couldn't care less about 
those fools getting kidnapped,</b>

00:58.890 --> 01:01.080
<b>but I'm interested in the 
ones who abducted them.</b>

01:02.760 --> 01:07.780
<b>I'll prepare you the perfect opponent 
to test the fruits of your training.</b>

01:12.910 --> 01:13.980
<b>This is indeed...</b>

01:15.070 --> 01:16.370
<b>entertaining!</b>

01:21.020 --> 01:23.670
<b>I've learned that I can 
grow even more powerful!</b>

01:25.480 --> 01:26.940
<b>Flame Magic...</b>

01:34.580 --> 01:36.370
<b>Hellfire Incarnate!</b>

01:39.370 --> 01:41.290
<b><i>Such phenomenal mana!</i></b>

01:41.640 --> 01:45.790
<b><i>It's as though her body itself is mana!</i></b>

02:00.480 --> 02:03.620
<b><i>Before I burn everything down...</i></b>

02:03.620 --> 02:06.440
<b><i>I'm going to defeat a legend!</i></b>

02:27.410 --> 02:29.880
<b><i>Mana Zone: Full Release!</i></b>

02:33.830 --> 02:38.100
<b><i>Calidos Brachium Purgatory: Abyss!</i></b>

02:47.640 --> 02:49.370
<b>Go back to sleep!</b>

02:50.080 --> 02:53.300
<b>And this time... forever!</b>

04:18.590 --> 04:23.990
<b><i>The Door to Hell</i></b>

04:28.400 --> 04:33.000
<b>I guess the rats that snuck in 
weren't from the resistance.</b>

04:33.440 --> 04:36.760
<b>Why are you still alive?</b>

04:37.010 --> 04:39.700
<b>It's all thanks to Captain 
Vangeance's magic!</b>

04:40.170 --> 04:42.020
<b>We'll be taking him back...</b>

04:42.760 --> 04:44.720
<b>after we defeat you!</b>

04:46.590 --> 04:48.640
<b><i>I know his powers.</i></b>

04:49.040 --> 04:51.210
<b><i>He uses his bone magic 
for absolute defense.</i></b>

04:51.600 --> 04:54.260
<b><i>They have overwhelming hardness 
and regeneration speed.</i></b>

04:54.260 --> 04:56.900
<b><i>Most physical attacks won't work on him.</i></b>

04:57.610 --> 05:00.690
<b>I see... What a foolish thing to do.</b>

05:01.180 --> 05:03.130
<b>Had you waited patiently 
in your own kingdom,</b>

05:03.130 --> 05:05.910
<b>you could've lived a little longer.</b>

05:06.380 --> 05:11.170
<b>I heard you had quite a bit 
of fun while I was gone.</b>

05:11.620 --> 05:16.300
<b>Sorry, but I'm not the kind of guy who 
can just let something like that stand!</b>

05:16.300 --> 05:18.480
<b>Archangel's Crash!</b>

05:19.090 --> 05:21.090
<b>A spatial mage, eh?</b>

05:24.510 --> 05:27.970
<b><i>And Absolute Space through 
his devil powers.</i></b>

05:28.630 --> 05:30.770
<b><i>He has complete control 
over the area's mana,</i></b>

05:30.770 --> 05:34.250
<b><i>and he can even interfere with 
and block his opponent's mana.</i></b>

05:34.960 --> 05:39.990
<b>You probably would've been the most 
powerful spatial mage if I weren't around.</b>

05:39.990 --> 05:43.360
<b>It's been a while since I've met 
someone who has the nerve</b>

05:43.360 --> 05:44.850
<b>to talk to me like that!</b>

05:45.200 --> 05:49.370
<b><i>Spatial Magic: Archangel's Destruction!</i></b>

05:49.810 --> 05:52.610
<b>I can understand that they 
sent you here in hopes</b>

05:52.940 --> 05:55.790
<b>of canceling out my spatial magic, but...</b>

05:56.110 --> 06:00.420
<b>Spatial Magic: Spatial Mana Dominion.</b>

06:03.320 --> 06:08.930
<b><i>When a mage is inside this space, 
they can't even maintain their magic.</i></b>

06:09.710 --> 06:12.180
<b>This spell is this huge 
without you moving an inch?</b>

06:12.860 --> 06:14.750
<b>Did your emotions sway you?</b>

06:14.750 --> 06:18.680
<b>There's nothing more foolish than 
accompanying someone who's lost before.</b>

06:19.220 --> 06:23.950
<b>You're just like your captain. 
You make foolish choices.</b>

06:24.430 --> 06:26.840
<b>Worthless pride and dreams...</b>

06:26.840 --> 06:29.330
<b>It's because you possess 
such things that you two</b>

06:29.690 --> 06:34.330
<b>will die without making me move 
even a single step from here.</b>

06:36.390 --> 06:38.450
<b>Let's go... Bell!</b>

06:40.610 --> 06:41.460
<b>Yeah!</b>

06:42.120 --> 06:44.590
<b>There you are, you bony bastard!</b>

06:49.980 --> 06:53.000
<b>I won't let you get away 
with what you did back then!</b>

06:53.930 --> 06:56.790
<b>Yuno and I are going to defeat you!</b>

06:59.090 --> 07:00.900
<b><i>Spirit Dive!</i></b>

07:08.030 --> 07:10.470
<b><i>Spirit of Boreas!</i></b>

07:11.350 --> 07:15.290
<b><i>What is this pressure and that spell form?</i></b>

07:15.600 --> 07:19.790
<b><i>No matter. He's completely 
powerless within this space.</i></b>

07:20.070 --> 07:22.550
<b>I'm the man who will 
become the Wizard King.</b>

07:23.040 --> 07:26.430
<b><i>I'm not going to let you 
keep your victory over me!</i></b>

07:27.740 --> 07:31.130
<b><i>The mana within the Absolute 
Space isn't under my control.</i></b>

07:31.130 --> 07:34.310
<b><i>Is he controlling it with 
an even greater power?</i></b>

07:34.770 --> 07:36.810
<b><i>No... He's just...</i></b>

07:38.870 --> 07:41.320
<b><i>loved by mana!</i></b>

07:45.040 --> 07:48.820
<b>We were going to die without even 
being able to move you a single step...</b>

07:48.820 --> 07:50.200
<b>was it?</b>

07:58.060 --> 07:59.330
<b>As if.</b>

07:59.710 --> 08:04.080
<b>Perish as you regret ever laying 
a finger on the Golden Dawn!</b>

08:05.510 --> 08:09.510
<b>You really do hate losing 
as much as dying.</b>

08:10.720 --> 08:11.830
<b><i>It's working!</i></b>

08:11.830 --> 08:14.470
<b><i>We'll beat this guy, 
stop the advent of Qliphoth,</i></b>

08:15.170 --> 08:17.500
<b><i>and save Captain Vangeance!</i></b>

08:21.680 --> 08:23.480
<b>Aw, man...</b>

08:23.810 --> 08:28.240
<b>I heard there were intruders, 
but neither of you are little Noelle.</b>

08:28.640 --> 08:33.490
<b>I hope you'll show me if it's 
any fun fighting you two or not.</b>

08:34.300 --> 08:35.490
<b>But first...</b>

08:35.490 --> 08:38.900
<b>If you can't beat these two, 
you're not worth my time.</b>

08:40.070 --> 08:41.870
<b><i>Briar Creation Magic...</i></b>

08:42.230 --> 08:43.880
<b><i>Corpse-Hunting Briar Trees!</i></b>

08:44.310 --> 08:45.250
<b>Though...</b>

08:45.250 --> 08:49.760
<b>Between Morris's modifications and my 
curse, they're probably pretty strong.</b>

08:54.760 --> 08:55.970
<b><i>Picture Magic...</i></b>

08:56.930 --> 08:58.970
<b><i>Subterranean Groundswell!</i></b>

08:59.690 --> 09:01.870
<b><i>Sirens' Game!</i></b>

09:09.200 --> 09:10.610
<b>Hmm...</b>

09:10.900 --> 09:13.480
<b>I guess it's neat that you 
can take on many attributes</b>

09:13.480 --> 09:15.170
<b>with picture magic,</b>

09:15.170 --> 09:17.490
<b>but that seems like the gist of it.</b>

09:17.750 --> 09:21.020
<b>And the briar magic is a no-go.</b>

09:21.020 --> 09:24.770
<b>There is a compatibility issue, 
but she's definitely holding you back.</b>

09:24.770 --> 09:26.270
<b>Aw, man...</b>

09:26.270 --> 09:30.400
<b>I sure wish I could've fought the little 
anti-magic shrimp who took out Dante</b>

09:30.400 --> 09:33.830
<b>and the old guy who uses dark magic.</b>

09:34.260 --> 09:37.610
<b>I really wanted to make 
them my toys afterward.</b>

09:37.610 --> 09:41.650
<b>But him dying is what's going to open 
the gate to the underworld for us,</b>

09:41.650 --> 09:43.230
<b>so I've just gotta deal.</b>

09:43.480 --> 09:47.110
<b>Then again, Zenon was able to capture him,</b>

09:47.110 --> 09:50.180
<b>so I guess he's not all that after all.</b>

09:53.010 --> 09:56.700
<b><i>These past six months, while 
keeping up with my captain duties,</i></b>

09:56.700 --> 09:59.950
<b><i>I studied the Heart Kingdom's rune arrays.</i></b>

10:00.250 --> 10:03.670
<b>My goodness... You're a 
genius at this, Charlotte!</b>

10:04.470 --> 10:08.290
<b>Is the captain studying 
those arrays again?</b>

10:08.290 --> 10:11.420
<b>She's the earnest type, so she 
just doesn't know when to stop.</b>

10:11.420 --> 10:15.430
<b><i>Although a powerful curse had been 
cast upon myself and my magic,</i></b>

10:15.890 --> 10:19.680
<b><i>I learned how to control it and 
even use it to my advantage.</i></b>

10:20.210 --> 10:22.090
<b><i>Or so I thought, but I was wrong.</i></b>

10:23.100 --> 10:26.930
<b><i>The curse was a powerful shackle 
that restrained my magic.</i></b>

10:26.930 --> 10:32.940
<b><i>By mastering the rune arrays, I found 
the true way to use the cursed briars!</i></b>

10:33.240 --> 10:34.900
<b><i>Dorothy told me...</i></b>

10:35.370 --> 10:39.290
<b>The curse magic that exists in this 
world originated with Megicula.</b>

10:39.290 --> 10:42.040
<b>Megicula is the creator of all curses.</b>

10:43.460 --> 10:46.530
<b>Because of you, I...</b>

10:49.060 --> 10:51.010
<b>grew strong!</b>

10:52.240 --> 10:55.890
<b><i>She deployed the Mana 
Method within my spells...</i></b>

10:57.940 --> 11:01.720
<b>I wonder if good mana soil and 
water helped them grow well.</b>

11:02.130 --> 11:04.940
<b>Mana Method Modified Briar Magic...</b>

11:07.000 --> 11:08.720
<b><i>Blue Rose Paradise!</i></b>

11:11.220 --> 11:13.940
<b>The more powerful the enemy's curse, 
the more it absorbs,</b>

11:13.940 --> 11:17.450
<b>and the more beautiful 
these roses will bloom.</b>

11:17.450 --> 11:21.010
<b>The curse on those two is weakening?</b>

11:22.330 --> 11:23.720
<b>That human...</b>

11:23.720 --> 11:26.720
<b>She modified the curse on herself</b>

11:26.720 --> 11:29.840
<b>and turned it into a 
special anti-curse spell?</b>

11:30.320 --> 11:33.650
<b><i>To think that someone is 
actually capable of that...</i></b>

11:33.650 --> 11:34.840
<b><i>How very interesting!</i></b>

11:37.790 --> 11:41.290
<b><i>My missions and my friendly 
rivalry with the Magic Knights...</i></b>

11:42.040 --> 11:43.650
<b><i>My reincarnation into an elf...</i></b>

11:44.430 --> 11:46.850
<b><i>The rune arrays of the Heart Kingdom...</i></b>

11:48.080 --> 11:51.620
<b><i>Everything to this point had 
been nourishment for my magic.</i></b>

11:53.160 --> 11:56.250
<b>These are my current blue roses.</b>

11:56.250 --> 11:57.820
<b>And these...</b>

12:01.530 --> 12:04.200
<b>are my rightful red roses!</b>

12:05.370 --> 12:11.130
<b>Right now, I can use 
both blue and red roses!</b>

12:11.350 --> 12:14.820
<b><i>True Briar Magic: Queen of Briars!</i></b>

12:15.860 --> 12:19.840
<b><i>I'll save you and show you 
just how powerful I've become,</i></b>

12:20.570 --> 12:21.560
<b><i>Yami!</i></b>

12:22.330 --> 12:27.590
<b><i>Wait, then Charlotte became a captain
without even using her true power?!</i></b>

12:33.360 --> 12:36.650
<b>I just found the best opponent ever!</b>

12:37.410 --> 12:38.320
<b>Huh?</b>

12:38.610 --> 12:42.240
<b>Unfortunately, I'm not going to fight you.</b>

12:42.240 --> 12:43.920
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

12:43.920 --> 12:46.790
<b>I'll unravel myself in a jiffy and...</b>

12:47.070 --> 12:50.660
<b>Strength will do nothing 
against those briars.</b>

12:50.660 --> 12:54.540
<b>The stronger your curse, 
the stronger it binds you.</b>

12:54.820 --> 12:58.310
<b>No... Did you use my own 
strength against me?</b>

12:58.310 --> 13:01.630
<b>Come on! Have some fun with me!</b>

13:01.630 --> 13:03.180
<b>Come on!</b>

13:03.180 --> 13:04.380
<b>You were careless,</b>

13:04.380 --> 13:08.090
<b>arrogant, and let your guard 
down. That's why this happened.</b>

13:08.090 --> 13:10.420
<b>Oh, don't be like that!</b>

13:10.420 --> 13:15.360
<b>I just know we could have 
the best fight ever—</b>

13:15.360 --> 13:19.070
<b>I do not like ridiculous women like you.</b>

13:19.520 --> 13:22.390
<b>Wither away without getting your wish.</b>

13:22.390 --> 13:24.210
<b>That is my...</b>

13:25.380 --> 13:26.730
<b>punishment for you.</b>

13:30.710 --> 13:33.710
<b><i>Death Scythe: Lunatic Slash!</i></b>

13:37.570 --> 13:39.540
<b>Morris's sorcery science</b>

13:39.540 --> 13:43.870
<b>has improved my body's 
regenerative abilities even more.</b>

13:44.220 --> 13:47.790
<b>The only thing that has 
a chance of hurting me...</b>

13:50.130 --> 13:52.810
<b>is anti-magic.</b>

13:53.500 --> 13:54.830
<b><i>I figured as much.</i></b>

13:54.830 --> 13:56.730
<b><i>But if we're going to win...</i></b>

13:57.030 --> 13:59.900
<b>I'm just getting started!</b>

13:59.900 --> 14:02.540
<b><i>...we have to wager on Jack's 
magic that has the possibility</i></b>

14:02.540 --> 14:04.990
<b><i>of cutting things that can't be cut.</i></b>

14:04.990 --> 14:06.330
<b><i>However...</i></b>

14:06.330 --> 14:08.240
<b>That's just how it is.</b>

14:10.210 --> 14:12.370
<b>I have no use for you.</b>

14:12.800 --> 14:15.880
<b><i>Gravity Magic: Presence of the Demon King.</i></b>

14:16.910 --> 14:21.630
<b><i>The real question is if Jack can attack 
while being affected by gravity magic.</i></b>

14:21.630 --> 14:22.990
<b>Slotos.</b>

14:29.230 --> 14:31.740
<b><i>Devil Union Mode: Equus.</i></b>

14:31.740 --> 14:33.640
<b><i>Characteristic: Toughness.</i></b>

14:33.640 --> 14:39.270
<b>Oho! To think there was another devil 
host other than the anti-magic boy!</b>

14:40.850 --> 14:41.890
<b>Oh?</b>

14:42.900 --> 14:46.910
<b>You were so lively earlier. What happened?</b>

14:46.910 --> 14:49.760
<b>Are your height and attitude 
all that's big about you,</b>

14:49.760 --> 14:51.880
<b>Captain of the Praying Mantises?</b>

14:52.430 --> 14:54.830
<b>Talk is cheap.</b>

14:54.830 --> 14:57.540
<b>How about you start letting your 
skills do the talking instead?</b>

14:57.850 --> 14:59.500
<b>Why, you little—</b>

14:59.960 --> 15:02.670
<b>Don't... ignore me!</b>

15:03.310 --> 15:07.250
<b>Do you mind? I'm talking 
to that captain right now.</b>

15:16.090 --> 15:19.800
<b>Very good! Show me more of that malice!</b>

15:20.230 --> 15:23.820
<b>Will you keep me entertained 
until the gate opens?</b>

15:23.820 --> 15:26.840
<b><i>I can exchange blows with him 
but won't be able to land a critical.</i></b>

15:26.840 --> 15:28.720
<b><i>I can't kill this man.</i></b>

15:29.430 --> 15:32.080
<b><i>I have to get Jack to 
attack him somehow...</i></b>

15:32.550 --> 15:34.760
<b>On the other hand, you, 
the one glued to the floor...</b>

15:34.760 --> 15:36.710
<b>I heard him call you "Captain."</b>

15:37.180 --> 15:39.460
<b>You're rather boring.</b>

15:39.460 --> 15:40.210
<b>Get out of my way.</b>

15:49.030 --> 15:51.410
<b><i>My dad was a common hunter</i></b>

15:51.410 --> 15:54.560
<b><i>who made a living hunting 
birds and small game.</i></b>

15:54.980 --> 15:58.730
<b><i>He always said, "Don't mess with 
anything that looks stronger than you."</i></b>

15:59.570 --> 16:02.730
<b><i>He was a dependable and conservative guy.</i></b>

16:04.590 --> 16:09.040
<b><i>He was thrilled when he found out 
that my magic formed blades.</i></b>

16:09.040 --> 16:12.330
<b><i>He said it was fitting for a hunter.</i></b>

16:12.730 --> 16:14.930
<b><i>Just like my dad, I continued to hunt</i></b>

16:14.930 --> 16:17.830
<b><i>creatures weaker than 
me and sliced them up.</i></b>

16:26.060 --> 16:30.090
<b>Is this how I'm going to 
live the rest of my life?</b>

16:36.180 --> 16:41.270
<b><i>When I was around thirteen, my dad came 
back from the mountains a dead man.</i></b>

16:41.940 --> 16:44.770
<b><i>Yeah, I figured that would happen.</i></b>

16:45.310 --> 16:46.480
<b><i>They said he probably ran into</i></b>

16:46.480 --> 16:49.430
<b><i>the lord of the mountains 
while he was hunting.</i></b>

16:50.190 --> 16:54.210
<b><i>There were huge claw marks on his back.</i></b>

17:08.030 --> 17:10.380
<b><i>It's fine. I can win.</i></b>

17:23.130 --> 17:24.070
<b>Huh.</b>

17:24.070 --> 17:26.210
<b>Guess I'll join the Magic Knights.</b>

17:33.820 --> 17:34.820
<b><i>This guy...</i></b>

17:35.580 --> 17:38.240
<b><i>He's moving his blades along 
his body and sharpening them?</i></b>

17:39.830 --> 17:41.710
<b><i>I just want...</i></b>

17:42.010 --> 17:45.590
<b>Groveling and being 
protected. How pathetic.</b>

17:45.840 --> 17:48.850
<b><i>...to take the guys in front of 
me who're supposedly strong...</i></b>

17:48.850 --> 17:53.220
<b>Yami Sukehiro was also a captain, 
but at least he entertained me.</b>

17:55.980 --> 17:57.750
<b><i>...and slice them up!</i></b>

18:00.760 --> 18:02.480
<b><i>He cut through gravity!</i></b>

18:02.480 --> 18:05.860
<b>How about we test that 
out with your body?!</b>

18:08.930 --> 18:13.110
<b>You can attack me all you want, but a 
mere insect like you cannot kill me.</b>

18:17.070 --> 18:22.050
<b>Don't go... underestimating insects!</b>

18:25.380 --> 18:28.070
<b><i>The guys with the best reputations 
aren't always the strongest.</i></b>

18:28.070 --> 18:31.870
<b><i>The one who kills everything 
standing in his way is the strongest!</i></b>

18:31.870 --> 18:34.380
<b><i>I can't... regenerate?!</i></b>

18:35.450 --> 18:38.220
<b>It appears as though 
I've underestimated you.</b>

18:45.710 --> 18:47.730
<b>Is that all you've got, demon?!</b>

18:47.730 --> 18:49.950
<b>That mage is unbelievable...</b>

18:49.950 --> 18:52.570
<b>She defeated the ancient 
demon all by herself!</b>

18:53.330 --> 18:54.360
<b>Everyone!</b>

18:55.410 --> 18:56.400
<b>Ralph!</b>

18:56.400 --> 18:57.880
<b>Division Commander Albert!</b>

18:58.590 --> 19:00.130
<b>I'm glad you're all right!</b>

19:00.130 --> 19:02.550
<b>So you must've met Nacht, as well.</b>

19:02.550 --> 19:03.620
<b>Yes!</b>

19:03.620 --> 19:08.540
<b>Master Yuno has become 
a skilled wind mage!</b>

19:09.310 --> 19:11.800
<b>His appearance is the 
mirror image of Lady Ciel,</b>

19:11.800 --> 19:15.300
<b>and he has a strong heart 
just like Lord Loyce.</b>

19:16.470 --> 19:17.620
<b>I see.</b>

19:18.760 --> 19:20.310
<b><i>Wind magic...</i></b>

19:20.650 --> 19:24.290
<b><i>But perhaps, with Lord 
Yuno and the others...</i></b>

19:39.230 --> 19:40.620
<b>I see.</b>

19:40.620 --> 19:43.290
<b>I guess the most powerful 
Magic Knights from our kingdom</b>

19:43.290 --> 19:46.370
<b>were far stronger than I'd imagined.</b>

19:47.380 --> 19:51.500
<b><i>There's still plenty of time until 
the gate to the underworld opens.</i></b>

19:53.590 --> 19:56.380
<b>Are you going to entertain me, too?</b>

19:56.900 --> 20:00.590
<b>Shut up! Just die already!</b>

20:02.830 --> 20:04.100
<b><i>What is this feeling?</i></b>

20:09.300 --> 20:10.480
<b>That's...</b>

20:14.540 --> 20:16.130
<b>Giant roots?!</b>

20:16.130 --> 20:17.490
<b>Qliphoth!</b>

20:18.150 --> 20:19.100
<b>Plumede!</b>

20:20.830 --> 20:21.850
<b>Union...</b>

20:26.850 --> 20:28.580
<b>Mode: Felis.</b>

20:29.220 --> 20:32.170
<b>Shadow Magic: Heaven's 
Shadow Second Sight!</b>

20:36.400 --> 20:38.740
<b><i>I sense magic other than 
Yami and Vangeance's</i></b>

20:38.740 --> 20:41.300
<b><i>at the underground site 
of the advent of Qliphoth!</i></b>

20:41.840 --> 20:43.500
<b><i>That's...</i></b>

20:43.500 --> 20:47.480
<b><i>the magic scholar who was exiled 
from the Diamond Kingdom... Morris?</i></b>

20:51.310 --> 20:56.360
<b>I guess Vanica's selfish acts 
can prove useful at times.</b>

20:56.700 --> 20:58.430
<b>Using the wisdom of the Heart Kingdom,</b>

20:58.430 --> 21:02.420
<b>I found out a way to accelerate 
the Tree of Qliphoth's growth.</b>

21:03.460 --> 21:05.940
<b>To think that I've been 
blessed with such abilities</b>

21:05.940 --> 21:09.490
<b>like this in exchange 
for being born blind...</b>

21:11.580 --> 21:14.450
<b>The abilities of a devil host!</b>

21:15.810 --> 21:17.710
<b><i>Through the power of a devil,</i></b>

21:17.710 --> 21:22.940
<b><i>I was able to extract and 
transplant Loropechika's wisdom.</i></b>

21:24.270 --> 21:26.260
<b><i>I don't know how it's being done,</i></b>

21:26.260 --> 21:29.540
<b><i>but Morris is acting as an 
accelerant for the gate?</i></b>

21:31.240 --> 21:33.020
<b><i>The gate to the underworld is ope—</i></b>

21:33.020 --> 21:34.110
<b>Not good!</b>

21:34.110 --> 21:35.770
<b><i>We have to eliminate Morris!</i></b>

21:50.830 --> 21:53.110
<b><i>Felis Characteristic: Agility.</i></b>

21:53.110 --> 21:54.580
<b><i>Those two...</i></b>

21:55.220 --> 21:57.130
<b>I missed.</b>

21:57.130 --> 21:58.520
<b>I hit.</b>

21:58.840 --> 22:01.450
<b>Right now, everything is fun, isn't it?</b>

22:01.450 --> 22:03.680
<b>Yes, oh so fun.</b>

22:04.220 --> 22:06.350
<b><i>They're devils of the highest order!</i></b>
